sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(255,255,255) Operations and user
        participant Operator
        participant User
    end
    box rgb(255,255,255) Microsoft 365
        participant Teams
        participant Bot as Azure Bot Service
        participant BotLogs as Bot diagnostics
    end
    box rgb(255,255,255) Foundry and private data
        participant Activity as Activity Protocol
        participant Agent as Hosted agent
        participant Database as PostgreSQL
    end
    box rgb(255,255,255) Application telemetry
        participant Insights as Application Insights
    end

    rect rgb(255,255,255)
        Note over Operator,Activity: One-time, versioned setup
        Operator->>Bot: Deploy Bot, Teams channel, and diagnostics with Bicep
        Operator->>Activity: Retain Responses and Entra, add Activity and BotServiceRbac
        Operator->>Activity: Publish with Shared scope using an interactive user
        Activity-->>Operator: Return publication titleId
        Operator-->>User: Share the titleId launcher
    end

    rect rgb(255,255,255)
        Note over User,Insights: Each Teams conversation
        User->>Teams: Open launcher and send a message
        alt Fresh Foundry authentication is required
            Teams-->>User: Present the newest one-time sign-in link
            User->>Teams: Complete OAuth
        end
        Teams->>Bot: Send channel activity
        Bot-->>BotLogs: Record BotRequest and AllMetrics
        Bot->>Activity: Forward signed activity
        Activity->>Agent: Validate source IP, token, tenant, and RBAC
        Note over Agent: The conversation stays pinned to its creation-time agent version
        Agent->>Database: Read and write workflow and HITL state privately
        Database-->>Agent: Return state
        Agent-->>Insights: Export request, workflow, model, and safe database spans
        Agent-->>Activity: Return final customer-facing text
        Activity-->>Bot: Return one complete Activity response
        Bot-->>Teams: Deliver complete response
        Teams-->>User: Display final text
    end

    Note over Teams,Agent: Published Teams agents do not support token streaming or citations
    Note over BotLogs,Insights: Correlate timestamp and operation, conversation, session, and workflow IDs<br/>This is not one uninterrupted distributed trace
